id: pm-hqy7lr
title: Plan mutations emit the complete step collection instead of a bounded changed-step receipt
description: "During the 2026-09-28 ecosystem review, updating one field or status on the 15-step reconstruction plan emitted the full plan with all step bodies, linked items and resume context. Eight sequential update-step operations produced roughly 34902 tool-reported tokens of output. The mutation affects one step but response cost grows with the whole plan. This defeats the compact mutation default and agent tokens-per-completed-task goal. Preserve complete Plan functionality and explicit full inspection while making ordinary mutations cheap."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:cli","area:sdk","horizon:current",plan,token-efficiency
created_at: "2026-09-28T06:07:42.721Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-28T09:39:42.496Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-28T09:36:15.241Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-28T09:36:15.241Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Public SDK owns an explicit compact Plan mutation receipt while CLI and MCP share its semantics; A 1000-step fixture proves a single-step update stays inside its declared output ceiling with no unrelated body text; Explicit full inspection still returns all steps decisions evidence and resume metadata with truthful omissions and continuation contracts; Completed planning-journey token replay includes mutation responses and fails when full-plan amplification is reintroduced
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: SDK generates bounded Plan mutation receipts shared by CLI and MCP; typed SDK retains complete results and explicit full/deep recovery remains available. Added thousand-step persistence regression and fixed-ceiling planning transcript.
expected_result: "Single-step mutation output remains bounded independently of unrelated Plan content, with complete counts and safe full-state recovery."
actual_result: 9388 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage; linked checks and typecheck pass; real Node/Bun completion output 891 bytes; npx/bunx smoke passes. Local startup timing limitations remain recorded separately; hosted review and merge pending.
