    text: Graph composition now passes all 9 assertions after contextual prose references received honest related edges; existing semantic lineage remains intact. Record integrity passes. Mutation gate passed 323 killed/330 total with the same 7 reviewed equivalent waivers and zero new failures. Performance remains a local qualification limitation reproduced on untouched base; Node 24 passed all SDK entrypoint imports but several CLI timing ceilings still failed. Full coverage is restarting on CI-aligned Node 24 with four workers and unchanged inclusion/thresholds.
